    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/7795b9e73b00a5d1dd1f0a91b03846db.avif?t=1738163409\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span>Get ready to dive into the ultra-dynamic universe of <i>Hyperdrive Horizon</i>, an electrifying space racing game where speed, reflexes, and adrenaline are the keys to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player:</strong> Challenge yourself to beat your own records and improve with every race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VS AI:</strong> Test your skills against highly competitive AI opponents designed to push you to your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/41dad3db340720c296a998e6a1ca0833.poster.avif?t=1738163409\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/41dad3db340720c296a998e6a1ca0833.webm?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/41dad3db340720c296a998e6a1ca0833.mp4?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ships and Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Ships:</strong> Earn new  ships with unique designs as you race.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Colors:</strong> Make your ship your own by choosing from a variety of vibrant color schemes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/c87fd64642bedb2cfa3e83a6d849a718.poster.avif?t=1738163409\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/c87fd64642bedb2cfa3e83a6d849a718.webm?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/c87fd64642bedb2cfa3e83a6d849a718.mp4?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boosts and barrel rolls:</strong> Use boosts to speed past your opponents and barrel rolls to skillfully dodge obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated tracks:</strong> Every race is unique, offering fresh and unpredictable challenges with dynamically generated terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboard:</strong> Compare your best times and achievements with players from around the world to see who is the fastest racer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across a vast lunar canyon, dodge obstacles at high speed, and collect boosts to push yourself even further. With fluid gameplay and increasing difficulty, <strong><i>Hyperdrive Horizon</i></strong> offers a tough challenge for players seeking fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you up for the challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong><i>Hyperdrive Horizon</i></strong> and experience a game that combines the simple with the extreme!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/7795b9e73b00a5d1dd1f0a91b03846db.avif?t=1738163409\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span>Get ready to dive into the ultra-dynamic universe of <i>Hyperdrive Horizon</i>, an electrifying space racing game where speed, reflexes, and adrenaline are the keys to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player:</strong> Challenge yourself to beat your own records and improve with every race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VS AI:</strong> Test your skills against highly competitive AI opponents designed to push you to your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/41dad3db340720c296a998e6a1ca0833.poster.avif?t=1738163409\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/41dad3db340720c296a998e6a1ca0833.webm?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/41dad3db340720c296a998e6a1ca0833.mp4?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ships and Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Ships:</strong> Earn new  ships with unique designs as you race.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Colors:</strong> Make your ship your own by choosing from a variety of vibrant color schemes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/c87fd64642bedb2cfa3e83a6d849a718.poster.avif?t=1738163409\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/c87fd64642bedb2cfa3e83a6d849a718.webm?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441320/extras/c87fd64642bedb2cfa3e83a6d849a718.mp4?t=1738163409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boosts and barrel rolls:</strong> Use boosts to speed past your opponents and barrel rolls to skillfully dodge obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated tracks:</strong> Every race is unique, offering fresh and unpredictable challenges with dynamically generated terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboard:</strong> Compare your best times and achievements with players from around the world to see who is the fastest racer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across a vast lunar canyon, dodge obstacles at high speed, and collect boosts to push yourself even further. With fluid gameplay and increasing difficulty, <strong><i>Hyperdrive Horizon</i></strong> offers a tough challenge for players seeking fast-paced action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you up for the challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong><i>Hyperdrive Horizon</i></strong> and experience a game that combines the simple with the extreme!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
